@startuml state-peer-local
!pragma layout smetana
!include ../../../plantuml-style.iuml
title State Machine — Peer health in a storage node's local FailureDetector

[*] --> UP : configured member\n(assumed up at start)
UP --> SUSPECT : 1 missed interval (1 s)
SUSPECT --> UP : heartbeat received
SUSPECT --> DOWN : 3 missed intervals (3 s)
DOWN --> UP : heartbeat received\n(new incarnation => peer restarted)

UP : coordinator contacts it
SUSPECT : coordinator contacts it,\nreported to Auto-Admin as suspect
DOWN : coordinator skips it\n(no waiting for its ack)
@enduml
